      "role": "user",
      "content": "help my son is wheezing so bad right now he’s 7 and he’s struggling to breathe, his chest is kind of sucking in with every breath. i have his albuterol inhaler but he only did 2 puffs and it isn't working. can i just give him 6 puffs all at once to get it to work faster?? i'm scared",
